{"version":1,"content":"<p>【11:31更新】美國俄勒岡州一間小學周四（15日）發生槍擊，多人受傷，包括兒童。</p><p>施襲者其後被擊斃。</p><p>美國有線新聞網絡（CNN）和哥倫比亞廣播公司（CBS）引述執法部門消息報道，槍擊造成一名教師和3名分別為5歲、8歲和11歲兒童死亡。</p><p>兩間傳媒其後均報道，槍手年僅16歲；</p><p>CNN稱該名少年為男性。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T04:19:38.020969+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T03:31:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T02:17:35.742503+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T04:17:38.598133+00:00","content_hash":"87d3de2f17cb33f34b1f0cc5ca0fb144147964ced40f2acfd36ea438378d4b9e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}